ion and there's no  point to any of it  if you don't feel like you're getting  something out of it personally  it's not what i do full-time  but i really do find it a fulfilling  part of my life and i i honestly can't  imagine my life without it because i use  it  to express my emotions and even  understand myself a little bit better  anyway i hope this insight into my  songwriting song creating process  has been a little bit informative or at  least entertaining for you to watch  i'm happy to be back and i'm really  looking forward to showing you the  behind the scenes of the music video as  well because that was a really fun one  to make and i'm very proud of it i think  it looks awesome and i think jamie did  an amazing job as usual and i am really  freaking excited to  i said freaking it doesn't matter okay  i'm really freaking excited to  go back to the studio and  keep working on my music and make this  second dp  it's gonna be so good thanks to everyone  who does listen to the music that jamie  and i make  the  raw little acoustic songs that i put up  on youtube  i i really do appreciate it i honestly  never thought when i was younger writing  songs that i would ever have  any type of audience so  it really is a dream come true i'm yeah  i'm humbled thank you  if you want to see more of me make sure  that you catch me  on thursdays over on twitch where i'll  be streaming weekly i am not going to be  streaming on youtube weekly anymore  but  do go over to twitch give me a follow  there or subscribe if you're feeling  generous i have done a complete revamp  of  my twitch my youtube my patreon i'm  trying to take everything a little bit  more seriously this year so  wish me luck  we'll see how we go  um but yeah i'm looking forward to  getting getting back into it this year  with you i feel like i've taken a really  long break okay i'm gonna stop blabbing  now  have a lovely day evening i'll see you  in the next video and  bye  i know  you find it hard when you'